SDV demo:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:20ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, DL: 3ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:10ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, DL: 3ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:15ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, DL: 3ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 12ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, AD: 3ms+/-1ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 3ms+/-1ms)
App :
    Component Fusion :
        Signal Fusion_data
        Service S1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            publish Fusion_data
            periodic 15ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms
            execution 3ms+/-1ms
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S2:
            subscribe to Fusion_data
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            triggered on Fusion_data
            execution 3ms+/-1ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S1 -> Fusion_data -> S2 -> Brake